#
# This is a DATA-COVERAGE code only.
# We do NOT create agronomic stress thresholds from
# the development sample because:
# - sampling was risk-stratified,
# - predictors are not causal diagnoses.
#
# 0 = all 21 context features available
# 1 = partial context
# 9 = no static context available
